# Reference solutions for SPEC §11 acceptance scenarios (hand-built, verified on ReNamer 7.10). T10a is a negative demonstration,
# T13 (round-trip) has no probe, and T14 runs without the GUI-only serializer (asserting that ReNamer refuses the collision).
# They prove every fixture in §11 is achievable within its rule budget. The skill must design its own; these are the yardstick.
# Dictionary fragments are trimmed to the terms each fixture needs.
@{ Cases = @(
  @{ Name = 'T1 prefix folder name'; Files = @('Icons\home.SVG'); Inputs = @('Icons\home.SVG'); Rules = @(
      @{ ID = 'Insert'; Comment = 'Prefix with parent folder name'; Config = @('TEXT=:File_FolderName: ', 'WHERE=1', 'POSITION=1', 'INSERTAFTERTEXT=', 'INSERTBEFORETEXT=', 'RIGHTTOLEFT=0', 'SKIPEXTENSION=1') }
